# Sooty Earth release freeze

Do not open or merge a pull request from `develop` into `main` until a production release is explicitly requested.

`develop` deploys Fly app `naturewatch`. `main` deploys Fly app `naturewatch-demo` (naturewatch.space). Feature work merges into `develop` only.
